{
  "id": "s1-06",
  "seasonId": "season-1",
  "episodeNumber": 6,
  "title": {
    "en": "The Sound of Chains"
  },
  "airDate": "2016-05-08",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "J-just barely made it in time.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729341425930756097",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Re:Zero episode 6 is starting! Skype got better, but that made my computer slow...　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729341540380762113",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The opening really is good... it makes it feel like it's truly started.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729341860678799360",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A punchline right out of the gate for the sponsor card.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729341952005545986",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": [
        "Mana & Magic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "That cat is so calculating, trying to steal the spotlight at just the right moment.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342044171182081",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Did you know? The game they're playing in the Redo PV isn't chess!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342204775256064",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Part A starts!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342252644859904",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Spinning Beatrice.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342341559947267",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "There's a rule that any anime with characters spinning around in it is a good anime...　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342483486801920",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "A big black thing with a nasty look in its eyes.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342571927871488",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Beako's beginning-of-every-turn rest time is over.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342695341088768",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "He really went headfirst straight into the fertilizer, huh.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342799640825856",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Cat appearance.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342898555133952",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "A cat that doesn't know how to hold back.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729342967429767168",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Orororo (in a certain manslayer style)　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343070060191745",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "A heartwarming little scene between Subaru and Puck.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343127840940033",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru",
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Conflict only occurs between those on the same level!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343199521607681",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Puck has fulfilled his quota of funny faces and funny voices.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343283999080449",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Such an easy heroine.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343451624407040",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "A drenched, tattered rag.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343590149689345",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "This stereo audio with Ram and Rem perfectly matched in one take really shows how wonderful voice actors are.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343676934062080",
      "characters": [
        "Ram",
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "An explanation of this loop's objective, and recovering from the failures up to the last one.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729343847709315073",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Seriously, what is he even supposed to do for information gathering? Go around asking, \"Did you kill me?\" That's way too much of a BAD route.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344006249848833",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "They really do properly fix the shrubs he messed up, don't they.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344165704699904",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "When in trouble, rely on Beako (this will keep working later too).　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344255714467840",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "First reveal in Japan: the world map.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344308826902529",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Seriously, this world map, we worked incredibly hard on it. If you're recording this, pause it and take a look.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344423314612226",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "Beako can't reach it. So cute.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344504193388544",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "With Beatrice, even when she tries to act intimidating, she's still cute, and that's the issue.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344645147168768",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "Now then, let me introduce you. The lifesaver from back then!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344792929275908",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "Even though Rem had just fixed it!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344861590028288",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "Part A ended so fast, and it's already commercial time.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729344937947357184",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "Part B begins!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345259272962048",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Puck is so calculating when he can't quite clasp his hands behind his head.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345405708685312",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "Big sister is starting to crack, and then slacking off.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345462814179330",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "Legs swinging.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345521857355777",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "The protagonist correction kicks in at a critical moment.　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345688417357824",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Now then, regarding the real story “The Red Ogre Who Cried,” there’s a behind-the-scenes story about how, in order to use it in the anime, so many people went to bat for us and made it happen...　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729345869531652096",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "This is Kobayashi-san reading \"The Red Ogre Who Cried,\" right?　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346098137980929",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "What must be going through big sis's heart here...? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346384814477312",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "Such gentle BGM is playing... ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346500266852353",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "\"You'll regret this someday\" ...you will, you will, you will...... ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346571427450881",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "The dragon story even properly comes with illustrations! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346652302008320",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "An abrupt, sudden conversation cancel ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346860645683201",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "It even comes with an illustration of the Witch!! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729346960172285952",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "\"On a white horse\" (super rare ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347081802932224",
      "characters": [
        "White Whale"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "\"Swear on the dragon\" = basically \"hand over your parents, lover, and pet as hostages\" is how I think of it ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347296253476864",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "It's nice that Emilia-tan properly keeps wearing the flower ornament the whole time ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347412641226753",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "Still, that mansion is huge. If Rem and Ram are taking care of it by themselves, then Rem's abilities are insane! Rem is amazing! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347604513837058",
      "characters": [
        "Ram",
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "Overlapping with the ED credits... and theeen... ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347761728954368",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "No matter how many times I see it, that iron ball's design is oni-level good ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347866175512578",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "text": "This chain effect, man... it's crazy, isn't it? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729347942679609344",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "This is Subaru, who survived Elsa. No matter who shows up, he won't lose!! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348052406837248",
      "characters": [
        "Elsa Granhiert",
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "text": "Sorry, but his heart broke first. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348132824223745",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "text": "The B part is over, or rather, episode 6 is over! So fast!! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348230325010432",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "text": "This is very personal, but isn't it great when girls have heavy-duty gear? It's great... it's romantic, right?　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348499444142080",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "text": "Episode 2 also ended with him dying, after all. If he died again this time, Subaru really would've made too little progress, so the development properly changed. That's a relief. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348701286584320",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "text": "Still, for convenience I call that thing a morning star, but what is the correct name for it, really? It's a Gundam Hammer, but I know \"Gundam Hammer\" isn't the right answer. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729348944006807552",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "text": "Personally, this time the highlight is the three slyly adorable stars: \"slyly adorable Pack,\" \"slyly adorable Emilia-tan,\" and \"slyly adorable big sis.\" ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729349375588073472",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "Also, as I tweeted during the broadcast, the first world map in the story appeared, in every sense. The author made it while grinning and looking over every kind of RPG world map imaginable, so I'd be happy if you'd check it out. If you look closely around the middle, there's even a certain huge tree. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729349726747779072",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "text": "Well then, sorry, and thank you again for this week. Please join me again next week! Next week, I think, probably, is suuuper interesting! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/729350413091119105",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    }
  ]
}
